  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Climate-Affected Families in West Bali</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will provide temporary infrastructure, boat repairs, Cash Voucher Assistance, shelters, and psychosocial aid to families in Pebuahan, West Bali, affected by abrasion and high waves triggered by extreme weather following the climate crisis. It will also provide educational activities for 1,200 families on disaster adaptation and mitigation. Our recovery plan includes disaster preparedness and economic rehabilitation, closely linked to adaptation efforts due to the climate crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
